CHANGELOG.md:36:        * No longer write seektables to Ogg, even when specifically asked for. Seektables in Ogg are not defined
CHANGELOG.md:133:    * The metadata iterations should now never return a vorbiscomment entry with NULL as an entry, now always at least an empty string is returned
CHANGELOG.md:440:    * Allow <span class="argument">[--picture](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_flac.html#flac_options_picture)</span> option to take only a filename, and have all other attributes extracted from the file itself.
CHANGELOG.md:444:    * Fixed a bug where new PICTURE metadata blocks specified with <span class="argument">[--picture](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_flac.html#flac_options_picture)</span> would not be transferred during FLAC-to-FLAC transcoding ([SF #1627993](http://sourceforge.net/p/flac/bugs/246/)).
CHANGELOG.md:446:    * Allow <span class="argument">[--import-picture-from](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_metaflac.html#metaflac_shorthand_import_picture_from)</span> option to take only a filename, and have all other attributes extracted from the file itself.
CHANGELOG.md:473:    * New <span class="code">[PICTURE](https://xiph.org/flac/format.html#def_PICTURE)</span> metadata block for storing things like cover art, new <span class="argument">[--picture](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_flac.html#flac_options_picture)</span> option to <span class="commandname">flac</span> and <span class="argument">[--import-picture-from](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_metaflac.html#metaflac_shorthand_import_picture_from)</span> option to <span class="commandname">metaflac</span> for importing pictures, new <span class="argument">[--export-picture-to](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_metaflac.html#metaflac_shorthand_export_picture_to)</span> option to <span class="commandname">metaflac</span> for exporting pictures, and metadata API [additions](https://xiph.org/flac/api/group__flac__metadata__level0.html#ga3) for searching for suitable pictures based on type, size and color constraints.
CHANGELOG.md:490:    * Added a new option <span class="argument">[--picture](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_flac.html#flac_options_picture)</span> for adding pictures.
CHANGELOG.md:509:    * Added a new option <span class="argument">[--import-picture-from](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_metaflac.html#metaflac_shorthand_import_picture_from)</span> for importing pictures.
CHANGELOG.md:510:    * Added a new option <span class="argument">[--export-picture-to](https://xiph.org/flac/documentation_tools_metaflac.html#metaflac_shorthand_export_picture_to)</span> for exporting pictures.
CHANGELOG.md:556:        * **Added** FLAC__metadata_get_picture()
CHANGELOG.md:568:        * **Added** FLAC::Metadata::get_picture()
CHANGELOG.md:607:        * **Added** FLAC__format_vorbiscomment_entry_name_is_legal()
CHANGELOG.md:608:        * **Added** FLAC__format_vorbiscomment_entry_value_is_legal()
CHANGELOG.md:609:        * **Added** FLAC__format_vorbiscomment_entry_is_legal()
CHANGELOG.md:610:        * **Added** FLAC__metadata_object_vorbiscomment_entry_from_name_value_pair()
CHANGELOG.md:611:        * **Added** FLAC__metadata_object_vorbiscomment_entry_to_name_value_pair()
CHANGELOG.md:612:        * **Changed** the signature of FLAC__metadata_object_vorbiscomment_entry_matches(): the first argument is now <span class="code">FLAC__StreamMetadata_VorbisComment_Entry entry</span> (was <span class="code">const FLAC__StreamMetadata_VorbisComment_Entry \*entry</span>), i.e. <span class="code">entry</span> is now pass-by-value.
CHANGELOG.md:824:<span class="code">metaflac --export-vc-to=- --no-utf8-convert file.flac | vorbiscomment --raw -w file.ogg
CHANGELOG.md:825:vorbiscomment --raw -l file.ogg | metaflac --import-vc-from=- --no-utf8-convert file.flac
